{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Gentle clinical support</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Psychotherapy for everyday and transitional moments. Confidential, clinical care in {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body class="page-root">
  <svg class="page-pattern" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <pattern id="p" width="40" height="40" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse">
        <rect width="40" height="40" fill="#f7fafc"/>
        <circle cx="6" cy="6" r="2" fill="#fde68a" opacity="0.35"/>
        <circle cx="34" cy="34" r="2" fill="#bfdbfe" opacity="0.28"/>
        <path d="M0 20 L40 20" stroke="#e6e6e6" stroke-width="0.5"/>
      </pattern>
    </defs>
    <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p)"></rect>
  </svg>

  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand">
      <h1>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>
      <p class="tagline">Reliable clinical care, thoughtfully offered</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="main-nav">
      <a href="index.html" aria-current="page">Home</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="specialties.html">Specialties</a>
      <a href="approach.html">How I Work</a>
      <a href="fees.html">Fees & Plans</a>
      <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="book.html" class="pill">Book</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h2>Clinical clarity for the days you want to feel more steady</h2>
          <p class="lead">Short, clear-minded therapeutic work that respects your time and boundaries. I partner with adults navigating life shifts, relationship strain, and revisitations of old patterns.</p>

          <div class="mood-module" id="mood-module">
            <label for="mood-select" class="mood-label">Pick your current mood</label>
            <div class="mood-options" role="list">
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="overwhelmed">Overwhelmed</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="stuck">Stuck</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="numb">Numb</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="anxious">Anxious</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="sad">Sad</button>
              <button class="mood-btn" data-mood="curious">Curious</button>
            </div>

            <div class="mood-recommendation" id="mood-recommendation" aria-live="polite">
              <h3 id="method-title">Starter Track</h3>
              <p id="method-desc">A gentle first set of sessions to orient, set boundaries, and make a pragmatic plan.</p>
              <a id="primary-cta" class="primary-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="hero-visual" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="280" height="220" viewBox="0 0 280 220">
            <rect x="8" y="8" width="264" height="204" rx="12" fill="#fff" stroke="#e6eef8"/>
            <g fill="none" stroke="#c7ddff" stroke-width="4">
              <path d="M36 160 C70 100 140 140 190 90" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="diagnostic" id="diagnostic">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>How I notice what's most helpful</h2>
        <p>I begin with a short diagnostic arc: two sessions to clarify what is most burdensome, what tends to help, and how we’ll track meaningful change. This is clinical work — not quick fixes. We keep goals tangible and scope bounded.</p>

        <div class="accordion" data-accordion>
          <button class="accordion-toggle" aria-expanded="false">Session boundaries & confidentiality</button>
          <div class="accordion-panel" hidden>
            <p>Sessions are standardly 45–55 minutes. Telehealth and in-person options depend on scheduling. Notes are kept in a secure practice record. Where safety concerns arise (risk to self or others), those limits to confidentiality are reviewed and handled in line with legal/ethical standards.</p>
            <p class="muted">If you are currently at risk of harm, call local emergency services or your crisis line immediately.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="plan">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Program tracks — pick a shape of work</h2>
        <p>Each track is built around clinical intent: clear entry goals, scheduled reviews, and an explicit off-ramp if progress or goals change.</p>
        <div class="plans-grid">
          <article class="plan-card">
            <h3>Navigator Cohort</h3>
            <p class="price">Cohort enrollment — monthly rhythm</p>
            <p>Small-group clinical learning with ongoing peer rhythm and individual check-ins. Best for people wanting gentle accountability and steady skill building.</p>
            <a class="plan-cta" href="book.html">Learn about the cohort</a>
          </article>

          <article class="plan-card">
            <h3>Solo Rhythm</h3>
            <p class="price">Weekly or biweekly individual sessions</p>
            <p>Traditional one-on-one therapy with a focus on pattern recognition, coping strategies, and boundary work.</p>
            <a class="plan-cta" href="book.html">Book a consultation</a>
          </article>

          <article class="plan-card">
            <h3>Focused Intensive</h3>
            <p class="price">Short burst of concentrated clinical hours</p>
            <p>3–5 session bundles for a narrow target (e.g., transitional planning, relationship review). Practical, time-limited, clinically attentive.</p>
            <a class="plan-cta" href="book.html">Explore intensives</a>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="micro_habits">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Small practices that matter</h2>
        <p>Between sessions, small shifts root clinical work in daily life. Below are simple experiments I often suggest.</p>
        <ul class="habits">
          <li>Three-minute grounding: name five things you see, four you feel, three you hear.</li>
          <li>Boundary rehearsal: a two-line script for a difficult request.</li>
          <li>End-of-day check: one thing that went okay, one small next step.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pricing" id="pricing">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Fees & access</h2>
        <p>Fees vary by program and cadence. Insurance may cover some services; I can provide superbills on request. Sliding scale spots are available for a limited number of clients; we discuss fit in intake.</p>
        <div class="pricing-grid">
          <div class="price-item">
            <strong>Navigator Cohort</strong>
            <span class="cost">Monthly cohort fee</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-item">
            <strong>Solo Rhythm</strong>
            <span class="cost">Standard per session fee</span>
          </div>
          <div class="price-item">
            <strong>Focused Intensive</strong>
            <span class="cost">Bundle pricing</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-block">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to start?</h2>
        <p>We’ll begin with a brief intake to clarify fit and goals. Nothing is promised; work proceeds at a pace you choose.</p>
        <a class="primary-cta big" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div class="wrap footer-grid">
        <div>
          <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong>
          <p>{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
          <p><a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> — <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Quick links</h4>
          <nav>
            <a href="about.html">About</a>
            <a href="fees.html">Fees</a>
            <a href="faq.html">FAQ</a>
            <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
          </nav>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h4>Safety & scope</h4>
          <p class="muted-small">I provide psychotherapy for adults. I do not offer emergency services. If you are in crisis, please dial local emergency services or your crisis hotline.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="copyline">&copy; <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}}. All client work follows clinician standards and ethical guidelines.</p>
    </footer>
  </main>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
